<title>POLAND: OLAWA JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>OLAWA JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.46 vs   0.16</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.75 vs   0.27</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.65 vs   0.16</p>
